error[V0222]: `"/users/{id}"` is not a valid prefix
  --> src/main.vr:11:19
   |
11 |     app.before_on("/users/{id}", check_user);
   |                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `"/users/{id}"` is not a valid prefix
   |
   = note: a prefix is matched on its segments as written, so `{id}` cannot be one of them; `"/users"` covers `/users/1` and `/users/1/posts`
